<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Black &amp; Decker.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Black &amp; Decker.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it trimmed its first quarter earnings estimate on Black &amp; Decker Corp to $0.26 a share from $0.30.</p>
<p>-- said it maintained its full-year 1997 estimate of $2.40 a share.</p>
<p>-- said longer term the company is well-positioned, but near-term earnings visibility remains uncertain.</p>
<p>-- reiterates hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Black &amp; Decker was off 1/4 to 31-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
